{"id":"599362","name":"竹筒饭","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"","cover":"images/599362/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米","amount":"75g"},{"name":"油粘米","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"100g"},{"name":"榨菜","amount":"1包"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1条"},{"name":"玉米","amount":"1条"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"油粘米和糯米浸泡三小时以上。","img":"images/599362/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"玉米粒剥好，胡萝卜切丁。","img":"images/599362/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"猪瘦肉切丁，用调料腌好。","img":"images/599362/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"二种米沥干水混合，放些盐和油，拌匀。","img":"images/599362/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入胡萝卜丁和玉米粒和腌好的猪肉。","img":"images/599362/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/599362/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再放入榨菜，拌匀。","img":"images/599362/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用勺子将米饭放入竹筒中，七分满，再加入适量清水。","img":"images/599362/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖上盖子，放入烤箱，210度烤40分钟。再焖十分钟。","img":"images/599362/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"开饭，还不错。","img":"images/599362/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}